fix_pplx_key.py
REVIEW_PROMPT_*.md

# ── local Python env (uv) + engine scratch; uv.lock IS tracked ──
.venv
kvs/

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`). One file leaked via `git add -A` in PR #9 and is removed here.
